m/TheStalwart/status/2115877222020227280"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-29T18:41:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115876658645291043"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Maybe the lines should be going up even more.", "display_url": "bloomberg.com/news/newslette…", "end": 184, "expanded_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-10-29/maybe-wall-street-has-never-been-ai-pilled?srnd=phx-oddlots", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115876660025151488/CX6cJrcc?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115876660025151488/CX6cJrcc?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 161, "status": 200, "title": "Maybe Wall Street Has Never Been ‘AI-Pilled’", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-10-29/maybe-wall-street-has-never-been-ai-pilled?srnd=phx-oddlots", "url": "https://t.co/sapLZxlzh1"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/z70NbnSNTL", "end": 208, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115876658645291043/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115876459600347136", "start": 185, "url": "https://t.co/z70NbnSNTL"}, {"display_url": "x.com/TheStalwart/st…", "end": 232, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/2115768728163922265", "start": 209, "url": "https://t.co/WZmTeqv9Wb"}]}, "id": "2115876658645291043", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 14077, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115768728163922265", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "In today's newsletter, I wrote about our chat with Barclays' Alexander Altmann, and one stat that caught me by surprise.\n\nThe forward PE ratio of SK Hynix? \n\n3\n\nhttps://t.co/sapLZxlzh1 https://t.co/z70NbnSNTL https://t.co/WZmTeqv9Wb", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115876658645291043"}, {"author_id": "3039504459", "created_at": "2026-10-29T18:28:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115873343614120436"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Experiments reveal a potentially useful odd--even dichotomy in the nonlinear Hall response of bilayer graphene.", "display_url": "go.aps.org/4iv2l3f", "end": 267, "expanded_url": "https://go.aps.org/4iv2l3f", "images": [{"height": 200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115873351008690176/i7hoXKzu?format=png&name=orig", "width": 200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115873351008690176/i7hoXKzu?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 244, "status": 200, "title": "Odd-Even Parity of Nonlinear Hall Effects in Bilayer Graphene", "unwound_url": "https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/3x42-zb9r", "url": "https://t.co/5q7OVO05HK"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/pYq1mkhKUZ", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2115873343614120436/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115873337838608384", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/pYq1mkhKUZ"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/pYq1mkhKUZ", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2115873343614120436/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115873340334153729", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/pYq1mkhKUZ"}]}, "id": "2115873343614120436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 767, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Researchers discover odd-even effects in nonlinear Hall response in bilayer graphene and show new magnetic contributions to the response, with implications for nonlinear electronics and low-dissipation, nonreciprocal devices.\n\nRead the Letter: https://t.co/5q7OVO05HK https://t.co/pYq1mkhKUZ", "url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2115873343614120436"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-29T18:28:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115873328334246217"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/alexolegimas/s…", "end": 206, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/alexolegimas/status/2115822019518370172", "start": 183, "url": "https://t.co/vFz0AOtfTy"}]}, "id": "2115873328334246217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 11901, "like_count": 85, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115822019518370172", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\"Because existing benchmarks only test whether AI can outperform individuals, a model can exceed the performance of every person one-on-one and still lose to a well-structured team.\" https://t.co/vFz0AOtfTy", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115873328334246217"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-29T18:22:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115871808066920765"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Weaker demand in China weighs on earnings as the German luxury automaker cuts its annual outlook and steps up cost reductions", "display_url": "caixinglobal.com/2026-10-29/mer…", "end": 89, "expanded_url": "https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-10-29/mercedes-benz-passenger-car-profit-falls-51-as-china-sales-slump-102498696.html", "images": [{"height": 373, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115871810424102912/4or31GQ7?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 560}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115871810424102912/4or31GQ7?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 66, "status": 200, "title": "Mercedes-Benz Passenger Car Profit Falls 51% as China Sales Slump", "unwound_url": "https://www.caixinglobal.com/2026-10-29/mercedes-benz-passenger-car-profit-falls-51-as-china-sales-slump-102498696.html", "url": "https://t.co/OHQjmSnek9"}]}, "id": "2115871808066920765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1077, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Mercedes-Benz Passenger Car Profit Falls 51% as China Sales Slump\nhttps://t.co/OHQjmSnek9", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2115871808066920765"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-